--- mutate
load csv "ring.csv" into edge:Knows mode overwrite header

--- expect ok

--- expect plan
load route: plan
load scan: partitions 1 fallback single_scan
load validate edge_ri edge:Knows from Person: access scan
load validate edge_ri edge:Knows to Person: access scan
load write: overwrite fragments
load executed: partitions 1 rows 2400

--- query
query ring_size() {
    match {
        $a: Person
        $b: Person
        $a knows $b
    }
    return { count($a) as n }
}

--- expect unordered
{"n": 2400}

--- expect shape
n: I64
